/**
 * Renders a number input (role="spinbutton"). The HTML `min`/`max` attributes
 * are set to `input.min_value`/`input.max_value` when provided. Clearing the
 * field calls `onChange(null)`; entering a number calls `onChange` with the
 * parsed numeric value.
